It is Thursday.
It is half past five in the evening.
I am going into the gym.
Today I am a little tired.
I work on the laptop every day.
That is sometimes very exhausting.
But my routine is important to me.
I train every Tuesday and Thursday at half past five.
An employee is standing at the door.
"Good evening!" he says friendly.
"Good evening," I answer.
The gym is full today.
I always train for an hour.
Sometimes I just run.
Today I do a lot of exercises.
After sports I am no longer tired.
I have a lot of energy now.
That is good for my next appointment.
At half past seven is my appointment at the hairdresser!
